# Canonical author identity for this repository.
#
# The history carries fifteen author identities, accumulated from assorted
# machines and assistant sessions: misspelled surnames, placeholder domains
# (example.com, lattice.org, cox.com), and commits authored as the assistant
# rather than carrying it as a Co-Authored-By trailer. All of them are the
# same person. This file maps them onto one identity, which is what git
# shortlog, git log and GitHub's contributors view read.
#
# Format:  Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>

